		<skos:notation>CredentialDefinitionAgent</skos:notation>
		<dc:description>Information linking a person or organization to a credential definition with the applicable role such as the author, publisher, or issuer or the credential.</dc:description>
		<skos:definition>Information linking a person or organization to a credential definition with the applicable role such as the author, publisher, or issuer or the credential.</skos:definition>
