		<skos:notation>IndividualizedProgramAssessmentAccessibilityFeature</skos:notation>
		<dc:description>Information about an accessibility feature specified as part of an individualized program that specifically addresses the context of an assessment taken by the student such as a screen reader or spoken instructions for a visually impaired student.</dc:description>
		<skos:definition>Information about an accessibility feature specified as part of an individualized program that specifically addresses the context of an assessment taken by the student such as a screen reader or spoken instructions for a visually impaired student.</skos:definition>
