		<skos:notation>IndividualizedProgramEligibility</skos:notation>
		<dc:description>Information that defines the eligibility of a student to receive individualized program services or accommodations such as through and IEP or 504 plan.</dc:description>
		<skos:definition>Information that defines the eligibility of a student to receive individualized program services or accommodations such as through and IEP or 504 plan.</skos:definition>
