		<dc:description>K12OrganizationStudentResponsibility handles CEDS elements "Responsible School Type" and "Responsible District Type". Different organizations may be responsible for attendance, accountability, funding, IEP, and transportation for a single enrollment.</dc:description>
		<skos:definition>K12OrganizationStudentResponsibility handles CEDS elements "Responsible School Type" and "Responsible District Type". Different organizations may be responsible for attendance, accountability, funding, IEP, and transportation for a single enrollment.</skos:definition>
	</rdfs:Class>
