		<skos:notation>NCESSIDEVintageBeginYear</skos:notation>
		<dc:description>The begin year for the American Community Survey (ACS) period estimates used to construct the National Center for Education Statistics (NCES) spatially interpolated demographic estimate (SIDE).</dc:description>
		<rdfs:comment>The NCES SIDE base is constructed from ACS five-year microdata. The NCES SIDE Vintage Begin Year indicates the first year of that five-year microdata base.</rdfs:comment>
		<textFormat>YYYY</textFormat>
		<skos:definition>The begin year for the American Community Survey (ACS) period estimates used to construct the National Center for Education Statistics (NCES) spatially interpolated demographic estimate (SIDE).</skos:definition>
