		<schema:rangeIncludes rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C000784" />
		<skos:notation>hasAdultEducationPostsecondaryTransitionAction</skos:notation>
		<dc:description>The action taken with respect to postsecondary enrollment by the learner after program exit or when co-enrolled in ABE and postsecondary with respect to enrollment in a postsecondary educational or occupational skills program building on prior services or training received.</dc:description>
		<skos:definition>The action taken with respect to postsecondary enrollment by the learner after program exit or when co-enrolled in ABE and postsecondary with respect to enrollment in a postsecondary educational or occupational skills program building on prior services or training received.</skos:definition>
	</rdf:Property>
