		<schema:domainIncludes rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C200017" />
		<schema:domainIncludes rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C200020" />
		<schema:rangeIncludes rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C200015" />
		<skos:notation>hasAssessmentAsset</skos:notation>
		<dc:description>References information about content used to compose an Assessment Item, is referenced by an item but not part of the item content itself, or is content that is included as part of a section within an assessment form. Assets can be static content such as artwork or dynamic assets such as calculators or other tools.</dc:description>
		<skos:definition>References information about content used to compose an Assessment Item, is referenced by an item but not part of the item content itself, or is content that is included as part of a section within an assessment form. Assets can be static content such as artwork or dynamic assets such as calculators or other tools.</skos:definition>
		<editHistory rdf:parseType="Collection">
			<editHistoryEntry>
				<changeDescription>Created definition to match the class definition it references.</changeDescription>
