		<skos:notation>hasApipInteraction</skos:notation>
		<dc:description>References information defining an assessment item interaction that may be specified using the IMS Global Accessible Portable Item Protocol APIP(R) standards.</dc:description>
		<skos:definition>References information defining an assessment item interaction that may be specified using the IMS Global Accessible Portable Item Protocol APIP(R) standards.</skos:definition>
