		<skos:notation>hasAssessmentItemApipDescription</skos:notation>
		<dc:description>References accessible Portable Item Protocol description for an assessment item that may use the IMS Global APIP(R) standards.</dc:description>
		<skos:definition>References accessible Portable Item Protocol description for an assessment item that may use the IMS Global APIP(R) standards.</skos:definition>
