		<skos:notation>hasAssessmentItemRubricCriterionResult</skos:notation>
		<dc:description>References information about an assessment result or score derived using a rubic criterion.</dc:description>
		<skos:definition>References information about an assessment result or score derived using a rubic criterion.</skos:definition>
