		<skos:notation>hasAccessibilityFeature</skos:notation>
		<dc:description>References information defining the type of design elements or functionalities integrated into products, services, or environments to ensure equitable access for all individuals, aiming to eliminate barriers and facilitate ease of use.</dc:description>
