		<rdfs:comment>Based on codes specified in the NCES Handbook &lt;a href="http://nces.ed.gov/pubs2015/fin_acct/chapter6_6.asp"&gt;"Financial Accounting for Local and State School Systems: 2014 Edition"&lt;/a&gt;.</rdfs:comment>
