		<skos:notation>hasPrimaryLearningDeviceAccess</skos:notation>
		<dc:description>An indication of whether the primary learning device is shared or not shared with another individual</dc:description>
		<rdfs:comment>When asking for this information on a parent or student survey, the question could be phrased like this: "Is the student's primary learning device shared with anyone else?"</rdfs:comment>
