		<skos:notation>hasQualifyingMoveFromCountry</skos:notation>
		<rdfs:comment>The CEDS Country Code option set comes from the &lt;a href="http://www.iso.org/iso/country_codes.htm"&gt;ISO 3166 standard&lt;/a&gt;, the short name for Officially assigned codes.   Discontinued codes from the ISO standard are not included in the CEDS list.</rdfs:comment>
