		<skos:notation>hasStandardizedAdmissionTestType</skos:notation>
		<dc:description>The type of test prepared and administered by an agency that is independent of any postsecondary education institution and is typically used for admissions purposes. Tests provide information about prospective students and their academic qualifications relative to a national sample.</dc:description>
		<skos:definition>The type of test prepared and administered by an agency that is independent of any postsecondary education institution and is typically used for admissions purposes. Tests provide information about prospective students and their academic qualifications relative to a national sample.</skos:definition>
	</rdf:Property>
