		<skos:notation>hasAccreditingOrganization</skos:notation>
		<dc:description>References an authority that reviews an organization's educational program and staff for quality, and certifies whether the organization meets a minimal set of standards.</dc:description>
		<skos:definition>References an authority that reviews an organization's educational program and staff for quality, and certifies whether the organization meets a minimal set of standards.</skos:definition>
