		<rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C000000" />
		<skos:definition>A local code used to describe balance sheet accounts and statement of net position accounts which are used to track financial transactions for each fund. Such financial statements only report assets, deferred outflows of resources, liabilities, deferred inflows of resources, and equity accounts and are considered "snapshots" of how these accounts stand as of a certain point in time.</skos:definition>
		<skos:notation>FinancialAccountLocalBalanceSheetCode</skos:notation>
		<skos:prefLabel>Financial Account Local Balance Sheet Code</skos:prefLabel>
	</owl:Class>
	<owl:Class rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C002008">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>A local code used to classify a fund which is a separate fiscal and accounting entity with a self-balancing set of accounts recording cash and other financial resources, together with all related liabilities and residual equities or balances or changes therein.</dc:description>
