	<owl:Class rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C001940">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>A self-identified barrier as defined by the Workforce Innovation and Opportunity Act (WIOA) that is presumed to affect placement of a participant in unsubsidized employment.</dc:description>
