		<skos:definition>International Baccalaureate (IB) Language B (Chinese Languages), Middle Years Program courses enable students to gain competence in modern Chinese languages and encourage respect for and understanding of other languages and cultures. These courses may be used for any Chinese language, including Mandarin and Cantonese.</skos:definition>
