		<skos:definition>Courses in Agricultural Mechanics and Construction�Independent Study, often conducted with instructors as mentors, enable students to topics of interest related to agricultural mechanics and/or construction. Independent Study courses may serve as an opportunity for students to expand their expertise in a particular application, to explore a topic in greater detail, or to develop more advanced skills.</skos:definition>
		<skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C001517" />
		<skos:notation>18447</skos:notation>
