		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>Courses in Natural Resources�Independent Study, often conducted with instructors as mentors, enable students to explore topics of interest related to natural resources. Independent Study courses may serve as an opportunity for students to expand their expertise in a particular application, to explore a topic in greater detail, or to develop more advanced skills.</dc:description>
