		<skos:definition>Communication Instruction courses are typically indiviualized according to each student's condition and needs. Increasing the student's communication skills�oral expression, listening comprehension, reading, and writing�is emphasized; communication techniques in several areas (Educational, social, and vocational) are often explored.</skos:definition>
