	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI001517163342">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>Mathematics�Supplemental courses, designed to be taken in addition to or in coordination with other mathematics courses, provide instruction to assist students in acquiring mathematic skills so that students attain necessary grade-level skills or reach a desired competency level.</dc:description>
