	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI002086181571">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>A person who was enrolled on a full-time or part-time basis for at least one complete term at any time in the year since leaving high school in an education or training program such as Job Corps, adult education, workforce development program, or vocational technical school which is less than a two-year program and does not meet the definition of option "Higher education within one year."</dc:description>
		<dc:identifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#token">NI002086181571</dc:identifier>
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C002086" />
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept" />
		<rdfs:label>Other postsecondary education or training within one year</rdfs:label>
		<skos:definition>A person who was enrolled on a full-time or part-time basis for at least one complete term at any time in the year since leaving high school in an education or training program such as Job Corps, adult education, workforce development program, or vocational technical school which is less than a two-year program and does not meet the definition of option "Higher education within one year."</skos:definition>
		<skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C002086" />
		<skos:notation>1003</skos:notation>
		<skos:prefLabel>Other postsecondary education or training within one year</skos:prefLabel>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI002086181572">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>The indication of the status of a person within one year of leaving secondary school and who had an individualized education program in effect at the time they left secondary school is unknown due to either non-response from a direct survey of the individual or a lack of data through other data collection methods.</dc:description>
		<dc:identifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#token">NI002086181572</dc:identifier>
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C002086" />
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept" />
		<rdfs:label>Unknown</rdfs:label>
		<skos:definition>The indication of the status of a person within one year of leaving secondary school and who had an individualized education program in effect at the time they left secondary school is unknown due to either non-response from a direct survey of the individual or a lack of data through other data collection methods.</skos:definition>
		<skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C002086" />
		<skos:notation>9997</skos:notation>
		<skos:prefLabel>Unknown</skos:prefLabel>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI002086181566">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>Competitive employment means 1) A person who has worked for pay at or above the minimum wage in a setting with others who are nondisabled for a period of 20 hours a week for at least 90 days at any time in the year since leaving high school. This includes military employment. Or 2) A person who has performed work on a full-time or part-time basis for which that person is compensated at or above minimum wage and comparable to the company rate paid by the employer to employees without disabilities performing similar duties and with similar training and experience; receiving the same level of benefits provided to other employees without disabilities in similar positions; at a location where the employee interacts with other individuals without disabilities; and presented opportunities for advancement similar to other employees without disabilities in similar positions. For defining the rate of compensation for persons working on a "part-time basis" under this category, the standard of 20 hours per week for at least 90 days at any time in the year since leaving high school is required as part of this option. This definition applies to military employment.</dc:description>
		<dc:identifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#token">NI002086181566</dc:identifier>
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C002086" />
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept" />
		<rdfs:label>Competitively employed within one year</rdfs:label>
		<skos:definition>Competitive employment means 1) A person who has worked for pay at or above the minimum wage in a setting with others who are nondisabled for a period of 20 hours a week for at least 90 days at any time in the year since leaving high school. This includes military employment. Or 2) A person who has performed work on a full-time or part-time basis for which that person is compensated at or above minimum wage and comparable to the company rate paid by the employer to employees without disabilities performing similar duties and with similar training and experience; receiving the same level of benefits provided to other employees without disabilities in similar positions; at a location where the employee interacts with other individuals without disabilities; and presented opportunities for advancement similar to other employees without disabilities in similar positions. For defining the rate of compensation for persons working on a "part-time basis" under this category, the standard of 20 hours per week for at least 90 days at any time in the year since leaving high school is required as part of this option. This definition applies to military employment.</skos:definition>
		<skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C002086" />
		<skos:notation>1002</skos:notation>
		<skos:prefLabel>Competitively employed within one year</skos:prefLabel>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI002086181567">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>A person who was enrolled on a full-time or part-time basis in a community college (two-year program) or college or university (four or more-year program) for at least one complete term at any time in the year since leaving high school.</dc:description>
		<dc:identifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#token">NI002086181567</dc:identifier>
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C002086" />
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept" />
		<rdfs:label>Higher education within one year</rdfs:label>
		<skos:definition>A person who was enrolled on a full-time or part-time basis in a community college (two-year program) or college or university (four or more-year program) for at least one complete term at any time in the year since leaving high school.</skos:definition>
		<skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C002086" />
		<skos:notation>1001</skos:notation>
		<skos:prefLabel>Higher education within one year</skos:prefLabel>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI002086181568">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>The indication of the status of a person within one year of leaving secondary school and who had an individualized education program in effect at the time they left secondary school is an option other than the specific Part B Postsecondary Outcomes of: 1) Higher education within one year, 2) Competitively employed within one year, 3) Other postsecondary education or training within one year, or 4) Other employment within one year</dc:description>
		<dc:identifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#token">NI002086181568</dc:identifier>
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C002086" />
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept" />
		<rdfs:label>Not engaged Part B outcomes</rdfs:label>
		<skos:definition>The indication of the status of a person within one year of leaving secondary school and who had an individualized education program in effect at the time they left secondary school is an option other than the specific Part B Postsecondary Outcomes of: 1) Higher education within one year, 2) Competitively employed within one year, 3) Other postsecondary education or training within one year, or 4) Other employment within one year</skos:definition>
		<skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C002086"/>
		<skos:notation>9998</skos:notation>
		<skos:prefLabel>Not engaged Part B outcomes</skos:prefLabel>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI002086181569">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>The indication of the status of a person within one year of leaving secondary school and who had an individualized education program in effect at the time they left secondary school is an option not yet defined in CEDS.</dc:description>
		<dc:identifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#token">NI002086181569</dc:identifier>
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C002086" />
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept" />
		<rdfs:label>Other</rdfs:label>
		<skos:definition>The indication of the status of a person within one year of leaving secondary school and who had an individualized education program in effect at the time they left secondary school is an option not yet defined in CEDS.</skos:definition>
		<skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C002086" />
		<skos:notation>9999</skos:notation>
		<skos:prefLabel>Other</skos:prefLabel>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI002086181570">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>A person has worked for pay or been self-employed for a period of at least 90 days at any time in the year since leaving high school but does not meet the definition of "Competitively employed within one year."</dc:description>
		<dc:identifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#token">NI002086181570</dc:identifier>
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C002086" />
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept" />
		<rdfs:label>Other employment within one year</rdfs:label>
		<skos:definition>A person has worked for pay or been self-employed for a period of at least 90 days at any time in the year since leaving high school but does not meet the definition of "Competitively employed within one year."</skos:definition>
		<skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C002086" />
		<skos:notation>1004</skos:notation>
		<skos:prefLabel>Other employment within one year</skos:prefLabel>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
