	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI002074181486">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>This type of job comprises positions and assignments in an education environment that support the overall operation and management of the organization and are not directly involved in instruction of students.</dc:description>
