		<skos:definition>Family and Consumer Sciences�Independent Study courses, often conducted with instructors as mentors, enable students to explore topics of interest related to home- and self-management. Independent Study courses may provide students with an opportunity to expand their expertise in a particular application, to explore a topic in greater detail, or to develop more advanced skills.</skos:definition>
		<skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C001517" />
		<skos:notation>19297</skos:notation>
