	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI001671127610">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>Includes amounts for any accrued liabilities, including accrued interest payable, salary and benefit (payroll) accruals, and similar accrued expenses not found in another category. (FARM para. 420)</dc:description>
