		<rdfs:label>Gross Property Plant Equipment: Buildings</rdfs:label>
		<skos:definition>Used for reporting end of year values for buildings as a reconciliation of beginning of the year values with additions to and retirements of building values to obtain end of year values. Capitalized leasehold improvements should be included if the improvements are to leased facilities.</skos:definition>
		<skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C001671" />
		<skos:notation>GrossPropertyPlantEquipmentBuildings</skos:notation>
