	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI001853128774">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>When the space is made available for informal, drop-in activities. In this case, the user does not reserve the space in advance. Usually, spaces are made available for drop-in use during specified hours and often the spaces available for drop-in use are outside the school building on the school grounds.</dc:description>
