	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI000087140663">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>Professional staff members employed to provide early intervention services to infants and toddlers with disabilities or at-risk of experiencing a substantial developmental delay as defined by Part C of the Individuals with Disabilities Education Act (IDEA): The Early Intervention Program for Infants and Toddlers with Disabilities.</dc:description>
