		<rdfs:label>Part C Early Interventionists</rdfs:label>
		<skos:definition>Professional staff members employed to provide early intervention services to infants and toddlers with disabilities or at-risk of experiencing a substantial developmental delay as defined by Part C of the Individuals with Disabilities Education Act (IDEA): The Early Intervention Program for Infants and Toddlers with Disabilities.</skos:definition>
