	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI001940181081">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>The participant is a person who has aged out of the foster care system or who has attained 16 years of age and left foster care for kinship, guardianship or adoption, or an individual who were formerly in foster care, but returned to their families before turning 18.</dc:description>
