	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI001517162801">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>Grade 7 courses involve content that is not differentiated by subject area. These courses focus on content that is grade-specific and cover various subjects throughout the day, rather than a single subject-specific content area. Specific course content depends upon state standards for Grade 7.</dc:description>
