	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI001517164458">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>Engineering and Technology�Aide courses offer students the opportunity to assist instructors in preparing, organizing or delivering course curricula. Students may provide tutorial or instructional assistance to other students.</dc:description>
