		<dc:description>Staff supervising instructional programs including professional staff members or supervisors in an early learning program assigned specific duties related to instruction , or supervisors at a school district or sub-district level including curriculum coordinators or supervisors; in-service training staff; Title I supervisors; home economics supervisors; educational television staff; coordinators and supervisors of audiovisual services; and staff engaged in development of computer-assisted instruction.</dc:description>
