	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI001797129066">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>Underground storage tanks (USTs) store petroleum or hazardous substances. The greatest potential threat from a leaking UST is contamination of groundwater, the source of drinking water for most Americans.</dc:description>
