		<rdfs:label>Underground storage tank</rdfs:label>
		<skos:definition>Underground storage tanks (USTs) store petroleum or hazardous substances. The greatest potential threat from a leaking UST is contamination of groundwater, the source of drinking water for most Americans.</skos:definition>
		<skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C001797" />
		<skos:notation>02581</skos:notation>
		<skos:prefLabel>Underground storage tank</skos:prefLabel>
