	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI000242129394">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>A school that does not focus primarily on career and technical, special, or alternative education, although it may provide these programs in addition to a regular curriculum.</dc:description>
