		<rdfs:label>IB Language B�French</rdfs:label>
		<skos:definition>IB Language B�French courses prepare students to take the International Baccalaureate Language B exams. These courses focus on improving students' accuracy and fluency in oral and written communication (usually in the students' "second" language).</skos:definition>
