		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>IB Language B�World Language (Other Language) courses prepare students to take the International Baccalaureate Language B exams for a language not specified elsewhere in this classification system. These courses focus on improving students' accuracy and fluency in oral and written communication (usually in the students' "second" language).</dc:description>
