	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI001517163513">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>These courses cover particular topics in humanities such as the interrelationships among painting, sculpture, architecture, and music or the exploration of a particular time period rather than provide a general overview of the subject.</dc:description>
