		<rdfs:label>Fire Management�Workplace Experience</rdfs:label>
		<skos:definition>Fire Management�Workplace Experience courses provide work experience in fields related to fire management. Goals are typically set cooperatively by the student, teacher, and employer (although students are not necessarily paid). These courses may include classroom activities as well, involving further study of the field or discussion regarding experiences that students encounter in the workplace.</skos:definition>
		<skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C001517" />
		<skos:notation>15198</skos:notation>
		<skos:prefLabel>Fire Management�Workplace Experience</skos:prefLabel>
