		<skos:definition>All funds on deposit with a bank or savings and loan institution, normally in non-interest-bearing accounts. Interest-bearing accounts, however, that do not meet the definition of an investment (e.g., demand deposits that are interest-bearing) should be recorded herein as well.</skos:definition>
