	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI000488172912">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>School-related arrest, which is an arrest of a student for any activity conducted on school grounds, during off-campus school activities (including while taking school transportation), or due to a referral by any school official, is a consequence of an incident for the student(s) involved in an incident as perpetrator(s). All school-related arrests are also considered Law Enforcement Referrals, but not all Law Enforcement Referrals are School-Related arrests.</dc:description>
		<dc:identifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#token">NI000488172912</dc:identifier>
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C000488" />
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept" />
		<rdfs:label>School-related arrest</rdfs:label>
		<skos:definition>School-related arrest, which is an arrest of a student for any activity conducted on school grounds, during off-campus school activities (including while taking school transportation), or due to a referral by any school official, is a consequence of an incident for the student(s) involved in an incident as perpetrator(s). All school-related arrests are also considered Law Enforcement Referrals, but not all Law Enforcement Referrals are School-Related arrests.</skos:definition>
		<skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C000488" />
		<skos:notation>75001</skos:notation>
		<skos:prefLabel>School-related arrest</skos:prefLabel>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
