	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI001353117374">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>A liability account used to record a debt owed by one fund to another fund in the same governmental unit. It is recommended that separate accounts be maintained for each interfund loan.</dc:description>
