	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI001353117396">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>Obligations with a maturity of more than 1 year. These accounts should be used only with proprietary and fiduciary funds, as well as at the entity-wide level of reporting.</dc:description>
