	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI001517163221">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>Writing (kindergarten) courses engage students in activities to develop their writing skills. Course content may emphasize storytelling or personal expression. Specific content depends upon state standards for kindergarten.</dc:description>
		<dc:identifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#token">NI001517163221</dc:identifier>
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C001517" />
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept" />
		<rdfs:label>Writing (kindergarten)</rdfs:label>
		<skos:definition>Writing (kindergarten) courses engage students in activities to develop their writing skills. Course content may emphasize storytelling or personal expression. Specific content depends upon state standards for kindergarten.</skos:definition>
		<skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C001517" />
		<skos:notation>01130</skos:notation>
		<skos:prefLabel>Writing (kindergarten)</skos:prefLabel>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI001517163222">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>Writing (grade 1) courses focus on writing skills and may emphasize recognition and creation of various types of text; extension of vocabulary and writing skills; and the connection of language to the expression of ideas. Specific content depends upon state standards for grade 1.</dc:description>
		<dc:identifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#token">NI001517163222</dc:identifier>
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C001517" />
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept" />
		<rdfs:label>Writing (grade 1)</rdfs:label>
		<skos:definition>Writing (grade 1) courses focus on writing skills and may emphasize recognition and creation of various types of text; extension of vocabulary and writing skills; and the connection of language to the expression of ideas. Specific content depends upon state standards for grade 1.</skos:definition>
		<skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C001517" />
		<skos:notation>01131</skos:notation>
		<skos:prefLabel>Writing (grade 1)</skos:prefLabel>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI001517163223">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>Writing (grade 2) courses focus on writing skills and may build students' skills in independent writing by increasing writing fluency, vocabulary, and recognition of word and language patterns. They may also introduce or reinforce the rules of grammar and spelling. Specific content depends upon state standards for grade 2.</dc:description>
		<dc:identifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#token">NI001517163223</dc:identifier>
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C001517" />
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept" />
		<rdfs:label>Writing (grade 2)</rdfs:label>
		<skos:definition>Writing (grade 2) courses focus on writing skills and may build students' skills in independent writing by increasing writing fluency, vocabulary, and recognition of word and language patterns. They may also introduce or reinforce the rules of grammar and spelling. Specific content depends upon state standards for grade 2.</skos:definition>
		<skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C001517"/>
		<skos:notation>01132</skos:notation>
		<skos:prefLabel>Writing (grade 2)</skos:prefLabel>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI001517163224">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>Writing (grade 3) courses focus on writing skills and may emphasize independent writing in a variety of assignments. Some emphasis may also be placed on presentation skills. Specific content depends upon state standards for grade 3.</dc:description>
		<dc:identifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#token">NI001517163224</dc:identifier>
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C001517" />
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept" />
		<rdfs:label>Writing (grade 3)</rdfs:label>
		<skos:definition>Writing (grade 3) courses focus on writing skills and may emphasize independent writing in a variety of assignments. Some emphasis may also be placed on presentation skills. Specific content depends upon state standards for grade 3.</skos:definition>
		<skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C001517" />
		<skos:notation>01133</skos:notation>
		<skos:prefLabel>Writing (grade 3)</skos:prefLabel>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI001517163225">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>Writing (grade 4) courses focus on writing skills and may emphasize independent writing in a variety of assignments and require students to respond to different materials in different ways. Grammar and usage of the English language may also be emphasized. Specific content depends upon state standards for grade 4.</dc:description>
		<dc:identifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#token">NI001517163225</dc:identifier>
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C001517" />
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept" />
		<rdfs:label>Writing (grade 4)</rdfs:label>
		<skos:definition>Writing (grade 4) courses focus on writing skills and may emphasize independent writing in a variety of assignments and require students to respond to different materials in different ways. Grammar and usage of the English language may also be emphasized. Specific content depends upon state standards for grade 4.</skos:definition>
		<skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C001517" />
		<skos:notation>01134</skos:notation>
		<skos:prefLabel>Writing (grade 4)</skos:prefLabel>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI001517163226">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>Writing (grade 5) courses focus on writing skills and may extend students' skills in writing for particular purposes or audiences, distinguishing meaning and literary functions in texts, and fluency in writing. Specific content depends upon state standards for grade 5.</dc:description>
		<dc:identifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#token">NI001517163226</dc:identifier>
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C001517" />
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept" />
		<rdfs:label>Writing (grade 5)</rdfs:label>
		<skos:definition>Writing (grade 5) courses focus on writing skills and may extend students' skills in writing for particular purposes or audiences, distinguishing meaning and literary functions in texts, and fluency in writing. Specific content depends upon state standards for grade 5.</skos:definition>
		<skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C001517"/>
		<skos:notation>01135</skos:notation>
		<skos:prefLabel>Writing (grade 5)</skos:prefLabel>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI001517163227">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>Literature�Workplace Experience courses provide work experience in a field related to English literature. Goals are typically set cooperatively by the student, teacher, and employer (although students are not necessarily paid). These courses may include classroom activities as well, involving further study of the field or discussion regarding experiences that students encounter in the workplace.</dc:description>
		<dc:identifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#token">NI001517163227</dc:identifier>
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C001517" />
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept" />
		<rdfs:label>Literature�Workplace Experience</rdfs:label>
		<skos:definition>Literature�Workplace Experience courses provide work experience in a field related to English literature. Goals are typically set cooperatively by the student, teacher, and employer (although students are not necessarily paid). These courses may include classroom activities as well, involving further study of the field or discussion regarding experiences that students encounter in the workplace.</skos:definition>
		<skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C001517" />
		<skos:notation>01098</skos:notation>
		<skos:prefLabel>Literature�Workplace Experience</skos:prefLabel>
	</owl:NamedIndividual>
	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI001517163228">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>Other Literature courses.</dc:description>
		<dc:identifier rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#token">NI001517163228</dc:identifier>
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C001517" />
		<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept" />
		<rdfs:label>Literature�Other</rdfs:label>
		<skos:definition>Other Literature courses.</skos:definition>
		<skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C001517" />
		<skos:notation>01099</skos:notation>
		<skos:prefLabel>Literature�Other</skos:prefLabel>
