		<rdfs:label>English Morphology and Grammar</rdfs:label>
		<skos:definition>English Morphology and Grammar courses involve the study of the English language�its roots and derivations, structure and sentence patterns, dialects, writing and spelling systems, and uses as a communication tool.</skos:definition>
