	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI001517163262">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>Mathematics (pre-kindergarten) courses cover foundational skills and concepts related to mathematics. Content is age appropriate and conforms to any existing state standards for pre-kindergarten education.</dc:description>
