		<rdfs:label>Mathematics (pre-kindergarten)</rdfs:label>
		<skos:definition>Mathematics (pre-kindergarten) courses cover foundational skills and concepts related to mathematics. Content is age appropriate and conforms to any existing state standards for pre-kindergarten education.</skos:definition>
