		<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept" />
		<rdfs:label>Personal and Professional Skills</rdfs:label>
		<skos:definition>Personal and Professional Skills courses develop the attitudes, skills, and strategies students need for personal and professional settings. Topics include personal growth and development, interpersonal skills, intercultural understanding, and ethics.</skos:definition>
