	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI002167190001">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>An accessibility feature provided to address unique circumstances or logistical needs during testing, such as environmental adjustments or timing flexibility, which may be provided at the discretion of administrators or educators, except when required by a person’s individualized program.</dc:description>
