	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI002119190641">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>The reason why this student was exempted from retention in a grade level because the student was an English Learner student who has less than three years of instruction in an English Learner program.</dc:description>
