		<dc:description>Schools receiving Title I, Part A funds identified for comprehensive support and improvement (CSI) under ESEA section 1111(c)(4)(D)(i) because the schools received additional targeted support and improvement (ATSI) under ESEA section 1111(d)(2)(C-D) and did not satisfy the statewide exit criteria for such schools within a State-determined number of years.</dc:description>
