		<skos:definition>Schools receiving Title I, Part A funds identified for comprehensive support and improvement (CSI) under ESEA section 1111(c)(4)(D)(i) because the schools received additional targeted support and improvement (ATSI) under ESEA section 1111(d)(2)(C-D) and did not satisfy the statewide exit criteria for such schools within a State-determined number of years.</skos:definition>
		<skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C002182" />
		<skos:notation>CSIATSINOEXIT</skos:notation>
