	<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/NI002182928133">
		<dc:creator>Common Education Data Standards</dc:creator>
		<dc:description>Schools receiving Title I, Part A funds identified for comprehensive support and improvement under ESEA section 1111(c)(4)(D)(i) that have not satisfied the statewide exit criteria for such schools within a State-determined number of years and are required to implement more rigorous State-determined action.</dc:description>
