		<rdfs:label>Both</rdfs:label>
		<skos:definition>The magnet or special program's emphasis is 1) to attract students of different racial/ethnic backgrounds for the purpose of reducing, preventing, or eliminating racial isolation; and 2) to provide an academic or social focus on a particular theme (e.g., science/math, performing arts, gifted/talented, career academy or foreign language).</skos:definition>
		<skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/CEDStandards/terms/C002183" />
		<skos:notation>Both</skos:notation>
		<skos:prefLabel>Both</skos:prefLabel>
